BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:city-kcmo-2025-04-15@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T115707Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:Kansas City\, MO: RD-109 due
DESCRIPTION:Annual return\, tied to the federal filing deadline | Confirmed
  via a Wayback Machine archive of kcmo.gov's own Tax FAQs page (the live pa
 ge returns 403 to automated fetches\, so the archived snapshot of the same 
 official content was used): "Annual returns are due April 15 each year" and
  "Residents who are self-employed must pay the one percent tax on the net p
 rofit of their business by filing a profits return with the Revenue Divisio
 n by April 15 of each year." Corroborated by a third-party-hosted copy of t
 he official RD-109 form itself. | Authority: Wayback Machine archived snaps
 hot of kcmo.gov's own Tax FAQs page (live page returns 403 to automated fet
 ches) | Source: https://web.archive.org/web/20221009025655/https://www.kcmo
 .gov/city-hall/departments/finance/tax-home/tax-faqs | This date is compute
 d from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-announced change\; con
 firm against the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
